Changes from the example:

- appliance.kiwi: renamed the image, removed awscli, pciutils, and
  zram-generator, excluded amazon-ec2-net-utils, and removed the package manager
  from the finished image.
- config.sh: enables guestackd instead of set-hostname-imds.

The other listed files are unmodified.

